/*
 * Windows has no realpath(3).  _fullpath() builds a canonical absolute path
 * but does not require the path to resolve to an existing object, whereas
 * realpath() does.  Keep the observable "must exist" requirement by checking
 * existence with _access(..., 0) and failing with errno set, as realpath()
